# Reuse Map

The primary imports the pinned Block-12 primary only for the frozen code,
carrier, and fourteen-way probability law.  It constructs the new flag
eligibility and collision guard locally.

The independent checker imports only the structurally independent Block-12
stack.  It rebuilds the Block-13 predicate, integer lattice geometry, guarded
state dictionary, exact successor, endpoint census, and STOP normalization;
it never imports the Block-13 primary.

Shared SymPy and immutable lattice direction data are infrastructure, not
shared Block-13 adjudication logic.
